4201                                  196 ;;
4201                                  197 ; Generate the code for a split raster line.
4201                                  198 ; The code must be at 64 nops of course and must be generated from the ring buffer of the line data.
4201                                  199 ; Start and end code cannot be exactly the same of the ring buffer to respect nop alignment and 64 nops duration
4201                                  200 ; Input:
4201                                  201 ;  - IX: address of the configuration of the line
4201                                  202 ;  - H: high byte of the ring buffer
4201                                  203 ;  - DE: address of the line code to generate
4201                                  204 ; Side effect:
4201                                  205 ;  - Alter the ring buffer at the beginning to properly handle the 4 nops shift
4201                                  206 ;  - alter ring_buffer_read_pos to be at the next 4 nops position
